---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Arklogs, a personal archive for projects, research, and writing.">
  <div class="index-screen about-screen">
    <div class="index-kicker"><span>ARKLOGS / ABOUT</span><span>PERSONAL ARCHIVE</span></div>
    <div class="about-board">
      <div class="about-statement"><span class="board-label">CURATOR'S NOTE / A—001</span><h1>Built with<br /><em>curiosity.</em></h1><p>Arklogs is a place to show the work behind the result: what I built, what I investigated, where I got stuck, and what I learned.</p><a href="/projects/">EXPLORE THE WORK <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <div class="about-diagram" aria-hidden="true"><span class="diagram-orbit orbit-one"></span><span class="diagram-orbit orbit-two"></span><span class="diagram-cross cross-one">+</span><span class="diagram-cross cross-two">+</span><span class="diagram-core">A</span><span class="diagram-tag tag-one">MAKE</span><span class="diagram-tag tag-two">INVESTIGATE</span><span class="diagram-tag tag-three">DOCUMENT</span></div>
      <div class="about-note"><span class="board-label">WHAT LIVES HERE</span><p>Hardware projects and ESP32 experiments. Security research and CVE notes. CTF solutions. Smaller observations from the workbench.</p><p>The visual language is a starting frame for components the owner wants to draw by hand.</p><a href="/writing/">READ THE FIELD NOTES <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="index-footer"><a href="/">← BACK TO MAIN LINE</a><span>MAKE · INVESTIGATE · DOCUMENT</span></div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
